### ===== 주문 생성 =====

### 주문 생성 (장바구니 기반)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "cartItemIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "requestId": "order-req-001"
}

### 주문 생성 - 멱등성 확인 (동일 requestId로 재요청)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "cartItemIds": [1, 2, 3],
  "requestId": "order-req-001"
}

### 주문 생성 실패 - requestId 누락 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "cartItemIds": [1]
}

### 주문 생성 실패 - cartItemIds 비어있음 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

{
  "cartItemIds": [],
  "requestId": "order-req-002"
}

### 주문 생성 실패 - 인증 헤더 없음 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cartItemIds": [1, 2],
  "requestId": "order-req-002"
}


### ===== 사용자 주문 조회 =====

### 내 주문 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### 내 주문 목록 조회 (날짜 필터)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders?page=0&size=20&startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### 내 주문 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser01
X-Loopers-LoginPw: Test1234!

### 내 주문 조회 실패 - 인증 헤더 없음 (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders


### ===== Admin 주문 조회 (LDAP 인증 필요) =====

### [Admin] 주문 목록 조회 (전체)
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/orders?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### [Admin] 주문 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/orders/1
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### [Admin] 주문 조회 실패 - LDAP 헤더 없음 (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/orders
